      "text": "ask him any more questions, Matt. 22:46 (Mark 12:34; Luke 20:40). they questioned among themselves, Mark 1:27. I will also ask of you one question, Mark 11:29. doctors … asking them questions, Luke 2:46. arose a question between some of John’s disciples and the Jews, John 3:25. if it be a question of words and names, Acts 18:15. to be called in question for this day’s uproar, Acts 19:40. accused of questions of their law, Acts 23:29. asking no question for conscience sake, 1 Cor. 10:25. minister questions, rather than godly edifying, 1 Tim. 1:4. doting about questions, 1 Tim. 6:4. foolish and unlearned questions avoid, 2 Tim. 2:23 (Titus 3:9).",
